# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL: Persistent Cloud State Storage for Vercel Serverless
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If deploying to Vercel and you want state to sync across devices/browsers:
# Option A - Vercel KV (automatically set by Vercel when you add KV Storage):
# KV_REST_API_URL="https://..."
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN="..."
#
# Option B - Upstash Redis (free tier available at console.upstash.com):
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL="https://..."
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN="..."
